## 5.2 General Ledger (`gl_db`)

Merealisasikan BRD 9.5.4 (BR-556 s.d. BR-562+): mesin jurnal inti, jurnal manual & otomatis, recurring, revaluasi, period lock, reversal.

```mermaid
erDiagram
  JOURNAL_ENTRY ||--|{ JOURNAL_LINE : contains
  JOURNAL_BATCH ||--o{ JOURNAL_ENTRY : groups
  JOURNAL_ENTRY ||--o{ JOURNAL_ENTRY : reverses
  RECURRING_JOURNAL_TEMPLATE ||--o{ JOURNAL_ENTRY : generates
```

